      "image": "assets/images/233537/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Secure one end of a bacon strip to one end a hot dog using a toothpick. Wrap the bacon strip tightly around the entire hot dog, securing the far end with another toothpick; repeat for remaining hot dogs.",
